<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ECI Telecom started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ECI Telecom started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group Inc analyst Chandan Sarkar said Monday he had started coverage of Israel's ECI Telecom Ltd with ratings of short- and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Earnings per share estimates were $1.70 for fiscal 1997 and $2.07 for fiscal 1998. Sarkar's estimate for the 1996 fourth quarter is $0.37.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were up 1-1/8 to 23-1/2 on Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
